msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/spdxLicenseIdFunctionality|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid this record when a second value would make the record ambiguous — retire the assertion instead of weakening it, and never mirror it as a hand-authored shape."
msgstr "À éviter lorsque une seconde valeur rendrait l'enregistrement ambigu — retirez l'assertion plutôt que de l'affaiblir, et ne la reproduisez jamais sous forme de forme écrite à la main."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/spdxLicenseIdFunctionality|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Read together with logic:characteristicSort: the pair (logic:characterizes gmeow:spdxLicenseId, logic:characteristicSort logic:functionalProperty) is the whole obligation, and the OWL grounding view projects the matching characteristic from it."
msgstr "À lire avec logic:characteristicSort : le couple (logic:characterizes gmeow:spdxLicenseId, logic:characteristicSort logic:functionalProperty) constitue l'obligation entière, et la vue de fondement OWL en projette la caractéristique correspondante."

